WEBVTT

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:32.429
We should have been,
because it made a lot of smoke

00:16:32.453 --> 00:16:33.976
and it made a lot of noise,

00:16:34.000 --> 00:16:35.976
and it was powerful, you know.

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:37.976
And once in a while, they would blow up.

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:39.976
But I wasn't worried, by the way,

00:16:40.000 --> 00:16:41.976
about, you know,

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:43.976
the explosion causing
the destruction of the planet.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.976
I hadn't heard about the 10 ways

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.976
that we should be afraid of the --

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.976
By the way,

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.976
I could have thought,

00:16:52.000 --> 00:16:53.976
I'd better not do this because

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.976
they say not to, you know.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.976
And I'd better get permission
from the government.

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.976
If I'd have waited around for that,

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.000
I would have never -- the frog
would have died, you know.